{"id":"664823","name":"紫苏炒虾","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/664823/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虾","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜头","amount":"适量"},{"name":"紫苏叶","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"虾去头去虾线后开背洗净备用。","img":"images/664823/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"蒜头拍扁剁碎备用。","img":"images/664823/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"紫苏叶洗净切碎备用。","img":"images/664823/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"适量黄油备用。","img":"images/664823/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中热油放入虾。","img":"images/664823/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"大火将虾炒至微微金黄。","img":"images/664823/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入蒜末。","img":"images/664823/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入黄油。","img":"images/664823/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"中火翻炒均匀炒出黄油的香味。","img":"images/664823/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/664823/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"适量蚝油，盐调味。","img":"images/664823/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"将虾焖五分钟左右入味。","img":"images/664823/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"出锅前放入紫苏叶翻炒均匀断生即可。","img":"images/664823/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664823/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664823/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664823/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}